  fhir:ValueSet.description [ fhir:value "Classification of an ophthalmic measurement or analysis against the device\nnormative (age-matched reference) database: within normal limits, borderline, or outside\nnormal limits. Used for the overall interpretation of OCT macula and OCT RNFL / optic nerve\nhead analyses, and for the per-subfield deviation category of the OCT macula profile.\nBindings are extensible, so device-specific percentile categories (e.g. p<5%, p<1%) may be\nused when no concept here applies."] ;
